Z||000008||bHooper||05-25-2001||06:30 AM||||thanks Bill!  i will have to play around with that.<P>i'm glad eveyone likes the car!  Doug is a great person to deal with, and just a damn nice guy!<P>once i get the brakes straight then i will need to work on the rims.  per Doug, those rims came off of a 700,000 mile Fiero!  they have 3 or 4 coats of paint on them.  i plan to just sandblast and polish them down... leave em all shinney.<P><P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT 5 speed<BR>*Black '86 SE Automatic||||reg||1
